# Lumia 930 Synaptics RMI4 touchscreen (BLSP1 I2C2 0x4b).
#
# Navigation uses the on-screen bar (config_showNavigationBar, and
# qemu.hw.mainkeys=0 in system.prop). The touchscreen functions listed in
# the Windows DSDT so far are F01, F11 and F12, no F1A 0D buttons.
# TODO: check on the phone whether the touch controller reports Back,
# Start and Search keys (Synaptics F1A); the LineageOS 17.1 martini port of
# 2314372037 maps them. The common msm8974 Synaptics driver keeps 8-bit key
# codes, as on the 1520; if the keys exist, uncomment these lines and bring
# back the key disabler of the bandit tree (touch/, 0dbutton attribute).
# key 158   BACK        VIRTUAL
# key 172   HOME        VIRTUAL
# key 139   APP_SWITCH  VIRTUAL

# Double tap on the screen while it is off (touch firmware wakeup gesture)
key 143   WAKEUP
